<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Smurfit 1996 pretax profit 201 mln punts.</title>
<headline>Smurfit 1996 pretax profit 201 mln punts.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		12.6		   vs 28.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.7		    vs 2.6</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 4.2		    vs 4.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     201		    vs 420.08</p>
<p> Turnover		   2,594		  vs 3,033.82</p>
<p>NOTE - Jefferson Smurfit Group Plc is an Irish paper and packaging manufacturer.</p>
